# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever
# core.autocrlf the machine has. A CRLF working tree on Windows made
# module-sources/ differ from the published ZIPs, and a marketplace build there
# would have packed CRLF into them. Guarded by
# tests/unit/a-checkout-has-the-line-endings-the-repository-has.test.ts.
* text=auto eol=lf
